    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Assessment notes",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Observability path**  \nGKE workload logs \u2192 Cloud Logging \u2192 BigQuery \u2192 Grafana.  \nGKE resource and load-balancer metrics \u2192 Cloud Monitoring \u2192 Grafana.\n\n**Expected:** BigQuery error panel requires at least one application request/error in the selected time range. Monitoring panels may take 1\u20133 minutes for fresh GKE metrics."
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
